The multiplication table for $\mc W$ in the case of a minimal nilpotent $f$ is given by Table <<ref:table2>> (where $L$ is as in <<ref:virL>>, $\varphi(a), \varphi(b)$ are as in <<ref:phi>> for $a,b\in\mf g_0^f$, and $\psi(u), \psi(u_1)$ are as in <<ref:psi>> for $u,u_1\in\mf g_{-\frac12}$):

\begin {table}[H]

\begin{center} \begin{tabular}{c||c|c|c}

$\{\cdot\,_\lambda\,\cdot\}_{z,\rho}$ & $L$ & $\varphi(b)$ & $\psi(u_1)$

\hline \hline $L$ & $\begin{array}{l} (\partial+2\lambda)L \\ -(x| x)\lambda^3+4(x|x)z\lambda \end{array}$ & $(\partial+\lambda)\varphi(b)$ & $\big(\partial+\frac32\lambda\big)\psi(u_1)$

\hline $\varphi(a)$ & $\lambda\varphi(a)$ & $\varphi([a,b])+(a|b)\lambda$ & $\psi([a,u_1])$

\hline $\psi(u)$ & $\big(\frac12\partial+\frac32\lambda\big)\psi(u)$ & $\psi([u,b])$ & eq.<<ref:20130320:eq2>>

\end{tabular} \end{center} \end{table}

The $\lambda$-bracket of $\psi(u)$ and $\psi(u_1)$ is

\begin{equation}
\begin{array}{c}
\displaystyle{
\{\psi(u)_\lambda\psi(u_1)\}_{z,\rho}=
\sum_{k\in J_{\frac12}}\phi([u,v^k]^\sharp)\phi([u_1,v_k]^\sharp)
+\big(\partial+2\lambda\big)\phi([u,[e,u_1]]^\sharp)
} \\
\displaystyle{
+\frac{\omega_-(u,u_1)}{2(x|x)}\tilde{L}
-\lambda^2\omega_-(u,u_1)+z\omega_-(u,u_1)\,,
}
\end{array}
\end{equation}

where, for $a\in\mf g_0$, $a^\sharp$ was defined in <<ref:20130201:eq3>>.

In particular, $L$ is an energy momentum element for all $z\in\mb F$, $\varphi(a)$ is a primary element of conformal weight $1$ for every $a\in\mf g_0^f$, and $\psi(u)$ is a primary element of conformal weight $\frac32$ for every $u\in\mf g_{-\frac12}$.
